                                 owl:versionIRI <http://purl.org/spar/datacite/2026-05-05> ;
                                 owl:imports <http://purl.org/spar/literal> ;
                                 <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/abstract> "The DataCite Ontology is an ontology written in OWL 2 DL to enable the metadata properties of the [DataCite Metadata Schema (version 4.7)](https://datacite-metadata-schema.readthedocs.io/en/4.7/) to be described in RDF."@en ;
